sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Mobile app
  participant RC as reCAPTCHA Enterprise
  participant PA as Firebase Auth (Phone)
  participant EA as Firebase Auth (Email/Password)
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  U->>App: Choose customer or artisan, enter name, phone and password
  App->>FS: Read settings/platform (smsSignUp switch)
  alt SMS verification is on
    App->>RC: Invisible robot check (hidden WebView)
    RC-->>App: Enterprise token
    App->>PA: Send verification code (phone number, token)
    PA-->>U: SMS with a 6-digit code
    U->>App: Enter the code
    App->>PA: Confirm the code
    PA-->>App: Number verified
  end
  App->>EA: Create the login for this role and number
  EA-->>App: New uid
  App->>FS: Create users/uid and publicProfiles/uid
  App-->>U: Open the home screen of the chosen role
